<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">CHANGELOG</p><h1>Progress you can inspect.</h1><p>A concise record of repository milestones. This page is not a published release history or a promise of API stability.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container changelog">
    <article><time>Current development</time><span class="status status-experimental">Unreleased</span><h2>Reactive UI prototype and release-readiness work</h2><ul><li>Added a server-rendered reactive component lifecycle with named actions.</li><li>Changed reactive action authorization to deny by default unless a policy explicitly permits it.</li><li>Added browser coverage for server actions, DOM reconciliation, state preservation, and rejected requests.</li><li>Added project governance drafts; the license decision remains pending owner approval.</li></ul></article>
    <article><time>Framework foundation</time><span class="status status-implemented">Repository state</span><h2>Independent PHP framework building blocks</h2><ul><li>HTTP bootstrap, request/response lifecycle, routing, and middleware.</li><li>Configuration, environment loading, validation, logging, safe templates, sessions, and CSRF building blocks.</li><li>PDO database helpers, migrations, command-line tooling, and tests.</li></ul><p>See <a href="/features">feature status</a> for tested versus experimental scope. No stable release number is advertised here.</p></article>
</div></section>
